# Dev-only apt packages (Debian/Ubuntu).
# Installed by `make venv` when EXTRAS includes `dev`, and by
# `make apt-deps APT_PROFILE=dev`.

# Static analysis for *.sh. OPTIONAL fallback only: the shell-lint gate prefers the pinned
# `shellcheck-py` wheel from the `dev` extra (.venv/bin/shellcheck), which every host and GitHub CI
# get from `uv`. This apt package is what a host with a lean venv falls back to, at whatever
# version the distro ships.
shellcheck
